---
layout: page.njk
title: The Game
permalink: /game/
intro: Everything Lord of the S'mores is, in more detail than the front page.
description: How Lord of the S'mores plays - the day, the night, dawn, the camp, the wilderness, the weather and what carries between runs.
---
<nav class="toc wrap" aria-label="On this page">
  <ul>
    {%- for s in gameSections %}<li><a href="#{{ s.id }}">{{ s.title }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</nav>
{%- for s in gameSections %}
<section class="feature wrap{% if loop.index is even %} feature-flip{% endif %}" id="{{ s.id }}" aria-labelledby="{{ s.id }}-h">
  <div class="copy">
    <h2 id="{{ s.id }}-h">{{ s.title }}</h2>
    {%- for p in s.text %}
    <p>{{ p }}</p>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <figure class="feature-shot">
    {% set shot = s.shot %}{% set alt = s.alt %}{% set sizes = "(min-width: 1100px) 600px, 100vw" %}{% set eager = false %}
    {% include "shot.njk" %}
  </figure>
</section>
{%- endfor %}
<div class="wrap">
  <section class="close-card page-signup" aria-labelledby="game-signup-h">
    <h2 id="game-signup-h">Get word when it's ready</h2>
    {% set formId = "game" %}{% include "signup.njk" %}
  </section>
</div>
